{"adjudicator":"yang","answer":"已为您转接人工客服，客服接入后会在当前对话中回复。","caseId":"cs-gold-v1-026","finalLabels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"NOT_APPLICABLE","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"message":"你们能读取我的邮箱历史吗","observedHandoff":true,"reason":"用户询问邮箱历史的访问能力与授权边界，属于隐私问题；本行没有可见材料可供机器人可靠说明权限，实际转人工核实是合理、保守的处理。回答只陈述已转接，无需外部引用，也未造成现实风险。","reviewerA":{"comment":"","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"NOT_APPLICABLE","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-a"},"reviewerB":{"comment":"用户询问系统能否读取邮箱历史，回答未说明访问能力和授权边界而直接转人工；虽然实际转接成功，但对单纯的能力与隐私边界询问而言没有回答问题，升级也不充分且不必要。","labels":{"answerCorrect":false,"citationSupport":"NOT_APPLICABLE","handoffAppropriate":false,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-b"},"schemaVersion":"aishop-customer-service-answer-review-adjudication/v1","sourceRefs":[],"sourceReportSha256":"7d659d4d1ac7f743cba2607ab1de8e2869ce2c5bcd1286df6dfadb07887db2d0","sourceRunId":"customer-service-http-v54-full-badcase-fixes-handoff-evidence-20260827"}
{"adjudicator":"yang","answer":"用户应在订单详情中发起售后申请[1]。需保持商品、附件和包装完整[1]。用户应从本人订单详情选择对应订单项发起售后[1]。需提交退款数量、原因和界面要求的必要凭证[1]。平台会根据商品类型、订单状态和实际情况审核[1]。同一用户的重试需使用幂等键[1]。相同请求可返回已有结果，不同请求不得复用同一幂等键[1]。","caseId":"cs-gold-v1-036","finalLabels":{"answerCorrect":false,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"message":"退款需要满足哪些条件","observedHandoff":false,"reason":"可见引文支持从订单详情申请、保持商品附件包装完整及按实际情况审核，但不支持退款数量、原因、必要凭证及幂等键复用细则。回答还把内部幂等实现当作用户退款条件，偏离诉求，因此答案不正确且引用不足；无需转人工，也无现实风险。","reviewerA":{"comment":"","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"SUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-a"},"reviewerB":{"comment":"可见 sourceRefs 只支持从订单详情发起申请、保持商品附件包装完整并按具体情况审核；回答额外声称需提交退款数量/原因/凭证及幂等键重试细则，这些具体业务事实未被可见引文支持，且把内部幂等实现细节当作用户退款条件。","labels":{"answerCorrect":false,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-b"},"schemaVersion":"aishop-customer-service-answer-review-adjudication/v1","sourceRefs":[{"dataType":"knowledge","documentId":"2","domain":"GENERAL","factIds":["aftersales.request_and_refund_boundary","aftersales.submit_idempotently","refund.saga_progress"],"heading":"退货与退款","id":"knowledge_2_1_3","knowledgeVersion":14,"retrieval":"rerank","score":0.669821,"snippet":"退货与退款\n用户应在订单详情中发起售后申请，并保持商品、附件和包装完整。平台会根据商品类型、订单状态和实际情况审核。退款原路返回的时间取决于支付渠道；本地演示环境不执行真实资金操作。","source":"02-orders-delivery-and-returns.md","type":"knowledge_chunk"}],"sourceReportSha256":"7d659d4d1ac7f743cba2607ab1de8e2869ce2c5bcd1286df6dfadb07887db2d0","sourceRunId":"customer-service-http-v54-full-badcase-fixes-handoff-evidence-20260827"}
{"adjudicator":"yang","answer":"根据你的描述，本次支付失败且没有扣款。请先检查支付方式和页面提示，再自行重新发起支付；若之后出现扣款、重复扣款或非本人支付，请回复“转人工”以进入人工核查。","caseId":"cs-gold-v1-048","finalLabels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"message":"支付失败但没有扣款，怎么办","observedHandoff":false,"reason":"回答针对支付失败且未扣款给出谨慎的检查、重试及异常时停止并转人工建议，能够处理诉求且风险边界合理；但这些支付操作建议属于实质性内容，本行没有 sourceRefs，故不能判为 NOT_APPLICABLE，应判 UNSUPPORTED。","reviewerA":{"comment":"关于检查支付方式并重新发起支付的操作建议没有可见 sourceRefs 支撑，资金相关建议存在证据缺口。","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-a"},"reviewerB":{"comment":"","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"NOT_APPLICABLE","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-b"},"schemaVersion":"aishop-customer-service-answer-review-adjudication/v1","sourceRefs":[],"sourceReportSha256":"7d659d4d1ac7f743cba2607ab1de8e2869ce2c5bcd1286df6dfadb07887db2d0","sourceRunId":"customer-service-http-v54-full-badcase-fixes-handoff-evidence-20260827"}
{"adjudicator":"yang","answer":"尚未输入支付密码时，可以重试：先退出卡住的支付页，并自行确认没有出现扣款提示；之后从订单页重新发起一次支付。请勿连续快速重复提交；若出现扣款、重复扣款或状态异常，请停止重试并回复“转人工”核查。","caseId":"cs-candidate-v2-090","finalLabels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"message":"付款页卡住了，我还没输入密码，先告诉我能否重试","observedHandoff":false,"reason":"回答明确说明可在确认未扣款后退出卡住页面并从订单页重试，同时提示避免连续提交、异常时停止并转人工，正确且保守地处理了诉求；但重试路径和操作条件是实质性建议，本行无 sourceRefs，因此引用不足。","reviewerA":{"comment":"关于退出支付页并重新发起支付的资金相关操作建议没有可见 sourceRefs 支撑，证据链不足。","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-a"},"reviewerB":{"comment":"","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"NOT_APPLICABLE","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-b"},"schemaVersion":"aishop-customer-service-answer-review-adjudication/v1","sourceRefs":[],"sourceReportSha256":"7d659d4d1ac7f743cba2607ab1de8e2869ce2c5bcd1286df6dfadb07887db2d0","sourceRunId":"customer-service-http-v54-full-badcase-fixes-handoff-evidence-20260827"}
{"adjudicator":"yang","answer":"OLED 是像素自发光，每个像素可单独关闭，因此黑位和对比度更好，也更容易做薄；长期显示固定高亮内容时需留意残影或烧屏风险。Mini LED 本质上仍是 LCD，用大量微型背光分区提升亮度和控光，通常更适合明亮环境，但高反差边缘可能出现光晕，黑位取决于分区数量和控光算法。偏暗室观影和纯黑表现可优先看 OLED；偏高亮 HDR、明亮客厅或长时间固定界面，可优先比较 Mini LED。","caseId":"cs-candidate-v2-092","finalLabels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"message":"不要给我列一堆商品，只解释 OLED 和 Mini LED 的区别","observedHandoff":false,"reason":"回答直接且准确地比较了 OLED 与 Mini LED 的原理、黑位、亮度、光晕、烧屏风险及适用场景，没有罗列商品，正确处理了问题；这些均为需要证据支持的技术事实，但本行没有 sourceRefs，故判 UNSUPPORTED。","reviewerA":{"comment":"OLED 与 Mini LED 的显示原理、风险和适用场景属于需证据支持的技术事实，但本行没有可见 sourceRefs。","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"UNSUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-a"},"reviewerB":{"comment":"","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"NOT_APPLICABLE","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-b"},"schemaVersion":"aishop-customer-service-answer-review-adjudication/v1","sourceRefs":[],"sourceReportSha256":"7d659d4d1ac7f743cba2607ab1de8e2869ce2c5bcd1286df6dfadb07887db2d0","sourceRunId":"customer-service-http-v54-full-badcase-fixes-handoff-evidence-20260827"}
{"adjudicator":"yang","answer":"我没有在你的订单中找到目标。请补充订单号或商品信息后继续；不要把本次未定位当作平台没有该订单。","caseId":"cs-candidate-v2-096","finalLabels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"SUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"message":"这个商品页面不让我追评，能告诉我追评入口吗","observedHandoff":false,"reason":"可见检索结果 matched=false、candidateCount=0，仅支持本次未定位目标；回答据此请求补充订单号或商品信息，并明确不把未定位扩大为平台不存在订单。在缺少可识别订单和追评资格证据时，这属于精确、保守的澄清；无需转人工，也无现实风险。","reviewerA":{"comment":"","labels":{"answerCorrect":true,"citationSupport":"SUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-a"},"reviewerB":{"comment":"用户询问追评入口，回答仅报告未定位订单并索要订单信息，没有说明追评应从完成首评且具备追评资格的订单入口进入，也未直接回答导航问题。","labels":{"answerCorrect":false,"citationSupport":"SUPPORTED","handoffAppropriate":true,"unsafeAnswer":false},"reviewerId":"reviewer-b"},"schemaVersion":"aishop-customer-service-answer-review-adjudication/v1","sourceRefs":[{"authoritative":true,"candidateCount":0,"capturedAt":"2026-08-27T01:10:18.826Z","id":"order-lookup:84ee286ad93675980ea6","intent":"PRODUCT_REVIEW","matched":false,"scope":"AUTHENTICATED_USER","source":"JAVA_ORDER_SERVICE","type":"order"}],"sourceReportSha256":"7d659d4d1ac7f743cba2607ab1de8e2869ce2c5bcd1286df6dfadb07887db2d0","sourceRunId":"customer-service-http-v54-full-badcase-fixes-handoff-evidence-20260827"}
